# Node (Vue/PrimeVue build tooling for the migrated editors)
node_modules/

# This environment's own local skill packs get materialized under
# .claude/skills/ regardless of the project -- not project content, and
# the exact reason `git add -A` once swept 174 unrelated files into a
# commit here. NOT a blanket `.claude/` ignore though: a skill actually
# *written for this project* (e.g. one documenting its own frontend
# conventions) belongs in .claude/skills/ and SHOULD be committed --
# stage it by name (`git add .claude/skills/<name>`), never `-A` this
# directory.
.claude/skills/banner-design/
.claude/skills/brand/
.claude/skills/design/
.claude/skills/design-system/
.claude/skills/slides/
.claude/skills/ui-styling/
.claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/

